51
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's so great...</font>

52
00:02:25,830 --> 00:02:29,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the three of you have things
