<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right...</font>

55
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, what is it?</font>

56
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You had something
