57
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm...</font>

58
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

59
00:02:45,930 --> 00:02:47,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, using that as a hint,</font>

60
00:02:47,850 --> 00:02:51,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">think about the fastest way
to get to the destination.</font>

61
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Start!</font>

62
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone!</font>

63
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:10,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry this happens all the time,
but class is over for today.</font>

64
00:03:10,870 --> 00:03:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yippee!</font>

65
00:03:11,830 --> 00:03:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Why?
— Huh? Not again.</font>

66
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The handout is your homework!</font>

67
00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Huh?!</font>

68
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:25,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so happy we didn't have
the class for Taijutsu.</font>

69
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But these days,
class either finishes in the morning</font>

70
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or we have the whole day off...</font>

71
00:03:31,730 --> 00:03:34,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's really okay.</font>

72
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with acting like
a serious student?</font>

73
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Konohamaru-chan?</font>

74
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:39,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

75
00:03:45,410 --> 00:03:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-chan?</font>

76
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-kun!</font>

77
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:08,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think you're doing
with Grandpa's things?!</font>

78
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honorable Grandson...</font>

79
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those belong to my Grandpa!</font>

80
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you taking them?!</font>

81
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... you mean these?</font>

82
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are no longer used,</font>

83
00:04:21,820 --> 00:04:24,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I thought I'd put them into storage
in a different location.</font>

84
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No longer used, you say...</font>

85
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:30,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think it's okay to take Grandpa's
things away without permission?!</font>

86
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage will be using
the chambers, you know.</font>

87
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage?</font>

88
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes.</font>

89
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next Hokage
has finally been decided.</font>

90
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The village can have peace of mind now.</font>

91
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person apparently
doesn't smoke tobacco...</font>

92
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean, Fifth Hokage?!</font>

93
00:04:51,310 --> 00:04:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too soon for that!</font>

94
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you depended on
the Old Man up to recently!</font>

95
00:05:04,860 --> 00:05:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a lovely fragrance...</font>

96
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

97
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What are you doing?!</font>

98
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:17,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's exactly my question for you!</font>

99
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You perverted kid...</font>

100
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I dare you to say that again!</font>

101
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? You want me
to say it again?</font>

102
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:29,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Per-vert-ed kid!</font>

103
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't call me that!</font>

104
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

105
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The elders are all waiting,
so we had better hurry.</font>

106
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:43,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I know.</font>

107
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful, little boy.</font>

108
00:05:49,740 --> 00:05:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please be more conscious
of your actions.</font>

109
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:54,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the person
who has to deal with the complaints...</font>

110
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, okay.</font>

111
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not a little boy!</font>

112
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the heck are you?!</font>

113
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:11,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my question...</font>

114
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan!</font>

115
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:15,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru?</font>

116
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see!</font>

117
00:06:20,230 --> 00:06:23,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, more importantly, have you seen
a big-boobed, scary old lady...</font>

118
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, young lady?</font>

119
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did see her!</font>

120
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Where did she go?!
— Who the heck is she?!</font>

121
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is she?</font>

122
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She has to go
to the hospital straightaway!</font>

123
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hospital?</font>

124
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:43,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That lady may not look it,</font>

125
00:06:43,170 --> 00:06:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but she's an awesome
Medical Corps Ninja!</font>

126
00:06:45,250 --> 00:06:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She finally came back to the village
to become the Hokage, so...</font>

127
00:06:48,420 --> 00:06:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what is she taking her sweet time for?!</font>

128
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage...</font>

129
00:06:53,050 --> 00:06:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage.</font>

130
00:06:57,220 --> 00:07:00,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She better do what
she promised to do.</font>

131
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're lying...</font>

132
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

133
00:07:04,650 --> 00:07:05,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't believe you!</font>

134
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:07,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a lie!</font>

135
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

136
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are seven birds within 50 meters
behind me in the direction of the "2."</font>

137
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten...?</font>

138
00:07:50,900 --> 00:07:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

139
00:07:55,910 --> 00:07:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just heard that that Tsunade-sama
has returned!</font>

140
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the real deal.
Wanna go see her?</font>

141
00:08:03,370 --> 00:08:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

142
00:08:05,330 --> 00:08:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm not interested.</font>

143
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

144
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there were...</font>

145
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">eight birds, huh...</font>

146
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully, Tsunade.</font>

147
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:18,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must call the feudal lords</font>

148
00:08:18,350 --> 00:08:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and announce the fact that
the Fifth Hokage has been chosen.</font>

149
00:08:22,350 --> 00:08:26,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will start preparations today
for the inauguration ceremony in the village.</font>

150
00:08:27,060 --> 00:08:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Feudal lords and ceremonies
are just a big pain.</font>

151
00:08:30,690 --> 00:08:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade!</font>

152
00:08:32,530 --> 00:08:37,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes, I know...
This is also the job of the Hokage.</font>

153
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:39,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Genma!
— Here!</font>

154
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Aoba!
— Here!</font>

155
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:43,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Issue an official notice and</font>

156
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">convey this matter to those in the village
within the next few days.</font>

157
00:08:48,710 --> 00:08:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must introduce the Fifth Hokage.</font>

158
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:52,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes, ma'am!
— Yes, ma'am!</font>

159
00:08:58,050 --> 00:08:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate you, Grandpa!</font>

160
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:01,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you have to die?</font>

161
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage...</font>

162
00:09:11,030 --> 00:09:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break,
my shoulders are so stiff.</font>

163
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wish I could just down
a nice cup of hot sake and relax.</font>

164
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:19,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

165
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a second!</font>

166
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before you do that,</font>

167
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have something else you need to do,
Granny Tsunade!</font>

168
00:09:26,500 --> 00:09:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was it?</font>

169
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you, didn't I?!</font>

170
00:09:29,340 --> 00:09:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About Kakashi-sensei and
Sasuke and Bushy Brow!</font>

171
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:34,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... right, right.</font>

172
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, if it isn't Naruto!</font>

173
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Shikamaru?</font>

174
00:09:40,430 --> 00:09:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you in a place like this?</font>

175
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my question-</font>

176
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you in a place like this?</font>

177
00:09:47,060 --> 00:09:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no idea why,</font>

178
00:09:48,690 --> 00:09:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but my father told me
to come along with him.</font>

179
00:09:51,690 --> 00:09:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with that?</font>

180
00:09:53,690 --> 00:09:56,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see, Tsunade-sama.</font>

181
00:09:56,490 --> 00:09:58,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, the kid from the Nara Family, huh.</font>

182
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you taking proper care
of the deer?</font>

183
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:04,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The antlers of the deer from
that area make very good medicine.</font>

184
00:10:04,450 --> 00:10:06,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I'm somehow managing.</font>

185
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Naruto, who's that person</font>

186
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:10,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who acts like such
a big shot when she's so young?</font>

187
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's apparently the new Hokage.</font>

188
00:10:13,130 --> 00:10:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

189
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite her appearance,
she's an old lady in her fifties.</font>

190
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

191
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, see you again sometime.</font>

192
00:10:21,350 --> 00:10:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, ma'am.</font>

193
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, to the hospital!</font>

194
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later, Shikamaru.</font>

195
00:10:27,230 --> 00:10:30,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will show you an awesome
new technique I learned!</font>

196
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the new Fifth Hokage...?</font>

197
00:10:33,070 --> 00:10:35,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Shikamaru.</font>

198
00:10:35,690 --> 00:10:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person is the strongest
and most beautiful person in the world.</font>

199
00:10:40,570 --> 00:10:41,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

200
00:10:41,990 --> 00:10:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, she's the lone female
amongst the Legendary Sannin.</font>

201
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... A female Hokage?</font>

202
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not very comfortable with women...</font>

203
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:55,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

204
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though they're unusually frank,
they always hang around and</font>

205
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're never quite sure
whose side they're on.</font>

206
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:08,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They always think they can make
men do whatever they want.</font>

207
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, they're just a pain.</font>

208
00:11:14,190 --> 00:11:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Shikamaru...</font>

209
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:19,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without women,
men wouldn't be born.</font>

210
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If women weren't around,
nothing good would come of men.</font>

211
00:11:25,450 --> 00:11:27,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how hard-edged
a woman might be,</font>

212
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she'll show her gentle side
to the man she loves.</font>

213
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe that Pa's saying that...</font>

214
00:11:34,420 --> 00:11:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when he's tied to Mom's apron strings.</font>

215
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll understand once
you reach that age.</font>

216
00:11:41,930 --> 00:11:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

217
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry up and
get our business done...</font>

218
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because Mom will chew us out
if we're late.</font>

219
00:11:49,390 --> 00:11:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up, Shikamaru!</font>

220
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like nothing will come
of some men</font>

221
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if they have a woman.</font>

222
00:11:57,980 --> 00:12:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Leaf Village Hospital"</b></font>

223
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm coming in.</font>

224
00:12:09,450 --> 00:12:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you...?</font>

225
00:12:15,210 --> 00:12:16,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a beautiful woman...</font>

226
00:12:17,290 --> 00:12:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan, Sakura-chan!</font>

227
00:12:19,050 --> 00:12:20,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything will be all right now!</font>

228
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I brought along an awesome person.</font>

229
00:12:24,430 --> 00:12:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke will be fine now!</font>

230
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

231
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two flowers aren't from
the same day.</font>

232
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this kid is coming here
every day, huh...</font>

233
00:12:40,370 --> 00:12:42,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard from Guy-sensei...</font>

234
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please save Sasuke-kun.</font>

235
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, leave it to me.</font>

236
00:13:27,110 --> 00:13:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

237
00:13:28,490 --> 00:13:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

238
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

239
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, you...!</font>

240
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:16,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, despite his appearance,
that Naruto is pretty considerate.</font>

241
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

242
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next! Next!</font>

243
00:14:22,090 --> 00:14:24,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How disgraceful!</font>

244
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be taken down by
just two insurgents.</font>

245
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And here I thought you were a genius.</font>

246
00:14:34,350 --> 00:14:35,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

247
00:14:36,230 --> 00:14:38,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Kakashi-sensei's done!</font>

248
00:14:38,850 --> 00:14:40,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, Bushy Brow!</font>

249
00:14:40,730 --> 00:14:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please hurry up and
take a look at my disciple Lee!</font>

250
00:14:46,530 --> 00:14:47,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee!</font>

251
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:51,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I brought Tsunade-sama here!</font>

252
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's your disciple?</font>

253
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:08,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! My beloved, beloved disciple!</font>

254
00:15:09,590 --> 00:15:10,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

255
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

256
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:14,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

257
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it really okay for you
to be idling away your time here like this?</font>

258
00:15:17,390 --> 00:15:18,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, I almost forgot!</font>

259
00:15:18,890 --> 00:15:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had an appointment to
meet Iruka-sensei!</font>

260
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:23,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go on!</font>

261
00:15:23,190 --> 00:15:25,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! I'll leave the rest in your hands!</font>

262
00:15:26,140 --> 00:15:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

263
00:15:31,450 --> 00:15:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

264
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:35,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're late, Iruka-sensei!</font>

265
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:36,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, sorry.</font>

266
00:15:36,450 --> 00:15:39,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There were lots of things to do
with respect to the Fifth Hokage.</font>

267
00:15:39,450 --> 00:15:41,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess...</font>

268
00:15:45,590 --> 00:15:46,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for waiting!</font>

269
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm digging in!</font>

270
00:15:52,470 --> 00:15:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

271
00:15:53,550 --> 00:15:54,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

272
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have really developed compared
to the time when you wanted this.</font>

273
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have, haven't I?</font>

274
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:02,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think so too, right?</font>

275
00:16:02,850 --> 00:16:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This headband that I received
from Iruka-sensei</font>

276
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">suits me perfectly, don't you think?</font>

277
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:12,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop being so cocky!</font>

278
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:14,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still have a long,
long way to go!</font>

279
00:16:14,990 --> 00:16:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have lots of work to do!</font>

280
00:16:18,660 --> 00:16:19,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully, Naruto!</font>

281
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village is in
a very difficult situation right now.</font>

282
00:16:23,790 --> 00:16:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Starting with the Third Hokage,
we lost many fine Shinobi.</font>

283
00:16:28,090 --> 00:16:30,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The current strength of the Leaf
is less than half what it normally is.</font>

284
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:33,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite that, we must continue
to carry out our missions.</font>

285
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is that?</font>

286
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't have enough manpower,
you should turn it down.</font>

287
00:16:37,430 --> 00:16:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that won't do...</font>

288
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we turn down our missions,</font>

289
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it would be like announcing
to other countries our weakened state.</font>

290
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Kakashi-sensei who is still ailing
will probably be assigned to missions.</font>

291
00:16:49,390 --> 00:16:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... these are difficult times.</font>

292
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! This concerns you too!</font>

293
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need to play an active role
and carry out your duties</font>

294
00:16:58,660 --> 00:16:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to aid Tsunade-sama.</font>

295
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

296
00:17:00,990 --> 00:17:04,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, before I do that,
I need to satisfy my stomach.</font>

297
00:17:07,130 --> 00:17:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just like you.</font>

298
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do your best!</font>

299
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:18,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seconds!</font>

300
00:17:18,930 --> 00:17:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey!
How'd you finish so fast?!</font>

301
00:17:25,890 --> 00:17:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be straight with you.</font>

302
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:30,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up being a Shinobi.</font>

303
00:17:42,290 --> 00:17:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Tsunade-sama...
don't joke like that.</font>

304
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are numerous bone fragments
in the area around important nerves.</font>

305
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, they are deeply embedded.</font>

306
00:17:56,760 --> 00:18:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not physically capable
of carrying out the missions of a Shinobi.</font>

307
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come now, Tsunade-sama,
don't joke like that...</font>

308
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I were to operate...</font>

309
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be fooled, Lee!</font>

310
00:18:09,350 --> 00:18:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Tsunade-sama is an impostor!</font>

311
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You changed yourself
using the Transformation Jutsu,</font>

312
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you evil woman!</font>

313
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell are you?!</font>

314
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't I have any... chance?</font>

315
00:18:36,090 --> 00:18:38,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no one besides me
who is capable of doing the surgery</font>

316
00:18:38,630 --> 00:18:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it would take too much time.</font>

317
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, there is a huge risk...</font>

318
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Risk?</font>

319
00:18:45,840 --> 00:18:49,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The probability of
a successful surgery is 50% at best,</font>

320
00:18:50,580 --> 00:18:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and if it fails...</font>

321
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll die.</font>

322
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei!</font>

323
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not at all ready
to throw in the towel!</font>

324
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:18,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei, what's this god-awful
bitter rice dumpling?</font>

325
00:19:19,470 --> 00:19:22,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are Youthful Vigor Herbal Pills.</font>

326
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you eat one hundred of them,
they should heal your wound.</font>

327
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:28,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, if I don't eat
one hundred of them,</font>

328
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:30,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my wound won't heal, right?</font>

329
00:19:34,230 --> 00:19:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Not in a single day!</font>

330
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:41,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's better that you give up being
a Shinobi and look for a different path.</font>

331
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

332
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

333
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I knew this was going to happen,
I shouldn't have brought you to him.</font>

334
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that...!</font>

335
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am painfully aware of how you feel,
but it's better to be clear.</font>

336
00:20:43,590 --> 00:20:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because it's something he'll have
to understand sooner or later.</font>

337
00:20:47,930 --> 00:20:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The longer we wait...</font>

338
00:20:50,430 --> 00:20:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the harder it will be for him.</font>

339
00:21:05,230 --> 00:21:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

340
00:21:05,230 --> 00:21:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

341
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

342
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

343
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

344
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

345
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

346
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

347
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

348
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

349
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

350
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

351
00:21:35,250 --> 00:21:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

352
00:21:35,250 --> 00:21:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

353
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:47,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

354
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:47,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

355
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

356
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

357
00:21:53,710 --> 00:21:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

358
00:21:53,710 --> 00:21:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

359
00:21:58,140 --> 00:22:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

360
00:21:58,140 --> 00:22:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

361
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

362
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

363
00:22:12,490 --> 00:22:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

364
00:22:12,490 --> 00:22:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

365
00:22:23,170 --> 00:22:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

366
00:22:23,170 --> 00:22:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

367
00:22:30,610 --> 00:22:35,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

368
00:22:30,610 --> 00:22:35,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

369
00:22:37,620 --> 00:22:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Konohamaru, just come out
from there already!</font>

370
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:41,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Shut up!</font>

371
00:22:42,040 --> 00:22:44,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Listen, I'll treat you to
a bowl of ramen!</font>

372
00:22:44,460 --> 00:22:45,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Don't want any!</font>

373
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Okay then. I'll add pork slices and eggs.</font>

374
00:22:49,510 --> 00:22:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You're such a pest!</font>

375
00:22:50,680 --> 00:22:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What did you just say?!</font>

376
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">In that case,
I'll pull you out by force!</font>

377
00:22:55,270 --> 00:22:56,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Be ready for that!</font>

378
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:59,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The One Who Succeeds The Will of Fire."</font>

379
00:22:59,980 --> 00:23:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Don't miss it!</font>

